id: dialog-slow-answer
section: Chrome, menus and dialogs
item: The slow human: a confirm answered 8 s after it came up — past any pickup deadline a harness meets by accident — still lands (the page reads "c: true")
shells: enyo mochi mojo
page: http://192.168.1.245:8077/jihad-dialogs.html
kit: cavekit-finger-testing.md R4
wait rect c 20
calibrate 'sel:p'
tap c
expect dialog present 8
pause 8000
chrome dialog-ok
expect dialog answered 8
wait text r 'c: true' 5
